---
system: sys-02-device-provisioning-registry
flow_id: consumer-provisioning
surface: mobile
spec_anchor: /software/systems/02-device-provisioning-registry#parent-app-endpoints
actors: [ParentApp, Gateway, DeviceService, Device, PostgreSQL]
apis:
  - POST /v1/devices/provision/start
  - POST /v1/device/provisioning/status
  - POST /v1/devices/provision/complete
externals: []
queues: []
failure_paths:
  - device_not_found
  - device_already_assigned
  - device_quarantined
  - provisioning_attempt_not_ready
  - device_auth_not_verified
  - child_profile_household_mismatch
idempotency: provisioningAttemptId per attempt — multiple provision/complete with same attempt id are blocked by attempt-status guard
retry: parent app retries on 5xx with exponential backoff
timeout: 5s p99 per endpoint
status: final
---
%% HAND-CURATED.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ParentApp
    participant Gateway
    participant DeviceService
    participant Device
    participant PostgreSQL

    ParentApp->>Gateway: POST /v1/devices/provision/start {serialNumber, appVersion, phonePlatform}
    Gateway->>DeviceService: forward (Parent bearer token)
    alt device_not_found
        DeviceService-->>ParentApp: 404 device_not_found
    else device_already_assigned
        DeviceService-->>ParentApp: 409 device_already_assigned
    else device_quarantined
        DeviceService-->>ParentApp: 409 device_quarantined
    else success
        DeviceService->>PostgreSQL: INSERT device_provisioning_attempts {status=started}
        PostgreSQL-->>DeviceService: provisioningAttemptId
        DeviceService-->>ParentApp: 200 {provisioningAttemptId, deviceId, deviceStatus=provisioning}
    end

    Device->>Gateway: POST /v1/device/provisioning/status {status=ble_paired,…,device_authenticated} (device cert)
    Gateway->>DeviceService: forward
    alt invalid_attempt_transition
        DeviceService-->>Device: 409 invalid_attempt_transition
    else success
        DeviceService->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE device_provisioning_attempts SET attempt_status
        PostgreSQL-->>DeviceService: ok
        DeviceService-->>Device: 204
    end

    ParentApp->>Gateway: POST /v1/devices/provision/complete {provisioningAttemptId, deviceId, assignChildProfileId, displayName}
    Gateway->>DeviceService: forward
    alt provisioning_attempt_not_ready
        DeviceService-->>ParentApp: 409 provisioning_attempt_not_ready
    else device_auth_not_verified
        DeviceService-->>ParentApp: 409 device_auth_not_verified
    else child_profile_household_mismatch
        DeviceService-->>ParentApp: 422 child_profile_household_mismatch
    else success
        DeviceService->>PostgreSQL: BEGIN — lock devices row, INSERT device_ownership_history, UPDATE devices, COMMIT
        PostgreSQL-->>DeviceService: ok
        DeviceService-->>ParentApp: 200 {device: {status=active, lifecycleState=assigned, …}}
    end

    Note over ParentApp,PostgreSQL: timeout 5s p99 · provisioningAttemptId guards re-submit · attempt-status state machine enforces transitions per spec §7.3
